1
00:00:02,722 --> 00:00:05,132
(Amy:)So Sheldon, there's something I've
been wanting to talk about

2
00:00:05,137 --> 00:00:07,037
(Amy:)but I know it's
kind of a touchy subject.

3
00:00:07,039 --> 00:00:09,239
(Leonard:)Way to narrow it down
to everything.

4
00:00:10,810 --> 00:00:12,240
(Sheldon:)What is it?

5
00:00:12,245 --> 00:00:13,575
(Amy:)Well, your birthday's coming up.

6
00:00:13,579 --> 00:00:14,779
(Amy:)And you've never
let us celebrate it.

7
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,710
(Amy:)And I was hoping maybe
this year we could.

8
00:00:16,716 --> 00:00:20,016
(Sheldon:)Oh, I suppose that's
a discussion we could have.

9
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,860
(Amy:)Okay, great, I mean,

10
00:00:26,859 --> 00:00:29,459
(Amy:)it doesn't have to be
a big party or anything.

11
00:00:29,462 --> 00:00:31,662
(Amy:)I was just...

12
00:00:33,866 --> 00:00:35,596
(Amy:)Where'd he go?

13
00:00:35,601 --> 00:00:36,771
W-Wait a minute.

14
00:00:36,769 --> 00:00:39,169
(Penny:)You mention his birthday
and he vanishes?

15
00:00:39,171 --> 00:00:42,471
(Leonard:)Well, where's that information
been this whole time?

16
00:00:43,543 --> 00:00:47,173
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

